# Files executed on the Linux Pi MUST stay LF — a CRLF shebang/line breaks bash,
# and CRLF trips PHP/Python/cron. Enforce LF in the repo regardless of the OS
# a commit is authored on (this project is developed on Windows, deployed on Pi).
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.php  text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.cron text eol=lf
